  | `/tmp/ci_product_run.log` | ~2m29s (03:27–03:30) | `bootstrap_no_cargo` — minisign missing, unsigned seed refused | `ci_product: FAILED` |
  | `/tmp/ci_product_unsigned.log` | ~4m19s (03:30–03:34) | `product_pure_dispatch_smoke.oo` — `test --fuzz` Int-domain rc=1 | `ci_product: FAILED` |

