  First signed-path FAIL is missing minisign. First unsigned-path FAIL
  is fuzz Int-domain. Many later FAILs are old residuals (forge-deny
  theater, fixture markers, bc banner noise).
  Product path is still `ci_product.oo` (GHA + PM). Twin runs `.oo`
